 *   - addRow(label, seats) appends a new empty row
 *   - book(label, seat) returns false for an unknown row, an out-of-range
 *     seat or a seat that is already taken; otherwise it takes the seat
 *   - cancel(label, seat) returns true only if that seat really was booked
 *   - freeSeats() counts the free seats across every row
 *   - findBlock(n) finds the FIRST row (in the order rows were added) that
 *     has n adjacent free seats and returns "LABEL:first-last" using the
